<--LBAC Order of Service Report
Version 4.1

PURPOSE
- Generate a one-page Order of Service from a Planning Center Services plan.

REPORT STRUCTURE
- Order of Service
- Service Notes

DYNAMIC CONTENT
- Service Date
- Plan Title
- Platform Assignments
- Song Titles
- Song of Anticipation Arrangement

HARD-CODED CONTENT
- Prelude • Call to Worship • Recorded Music
- Worship Team labels
- Theme/Greeting placeholder
- Service Notes heading
- Song of Anticipation is always the second-to-last song.

PLANNING CENTER SETUP

Platform Team Positions
- Worship Leader
- Prayer Leader
- Preacher
- Announcements
- Benediction

General Note Format

PLATFORM ROLES:
Preacher:
Prayer Leader:
Announcements:
Benediction:

These notes are only used when the corresponding Platform Team position is unassigned (for example, a guest speaker or guest prayer leader).

SONG ASSUMPTIONS

This report assumes every service contains either five or six songs.

Five-song service
1. Call to Worship
2–3. Songs of Worship
4. Song of Anticipation
5. Song of Response

Six-song service
1. Call to Worship
2–4. Songs of Worship
5. Song of Anticipation
6. Song of Response

PLAN TEMPLATE REQUIREMENTS

✓ Songs must be scheduled in service order.
✓ Speak O Lord is always scheduled as the second-to-last song.
✓ The final song is always the Song of Response.
✓ Platform Team positions should be assigned whenever possible.
✓ PLATFORM ROLES notes are intended only as a fallback.

DESIGN PRINCIPLES

1. Read data.
2. Sanitize data.
3. Apply business logic.
4. Render HTML.

No HTML should contain business logic beyond simple display checks.
-->


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Order of Service</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 11pt;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin: 0.5in;
        color: #000;
      }

      .page-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .service-section {
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .section-heading {
        font-weight: normal;
      }

      .song-title {
        margin-left: 2.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .subnote {
        margin-left: 2.5rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #333;
      }

      .service-notes {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
      }

      @media print {
        body {
          margin: 0.5in;
        }
        .service-section {
          page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
        .song-title {
          page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
      }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-title">
  Order of Service • {{ plan.plan_times.first.starts_at | date: "%B %-d, %Y" }}
</div>

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Prelude • Call to Worship • Recorded Music
</div>

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Worship in Singing • Worship Team
</div>

<div class="song-title">{{ song_1 }}</div>

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Welcome to Worship • {{ worship_leader }}
</div>

<div class="subnote">
  (Theme/Greeting)
</div>

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Songs of Worship • Worship Team
</div>

{% for song in worship_songs %}
  <div class="song-title">{{ song.title }}</div>
{% endfor %}

{% if prayer_leader %}
<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Prayer for the Church/Offering • {{ prayer_leader }}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Song of Anticipation • Worship Team
</div>

<div class="song-title">
  Speak O Lord{% if anticipation_arrangement %}, {{ anticipation_arrangement }}{% endif %}
</div>

{% if preacher %}
<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Message: "{{ plan.plan_title }}" • {{ preacher }}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if communion %}
<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Communion • {{ communion }}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="service-section section-heading">
  Song of Response • Worship Team
</div>

<div class="song-title">{{ response_song }}</div>

{% if announcements or benediction %}
<div class="service-section section-heading">
  {% assign title = "" %}
  {% assign names = "" %}

  {% if announcements %}
    {% assign title = "Announcements" %}
    {% assign names = announcements %}
  {% endif %}

  {% if benediction %}
    {% if title != "" %}
      {% assign title = title | append: "/Benediction" %}
    {% else %}
      {% assign title = "Benediction" %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if names == "" %}
      {% assign names = benediction %}
    {% elsif names != benediction %}
      {% assign names = names | append: ", " | append: benediction %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  {{ title }} • {{ names }}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="service-notes section-heading">
  Service Notes:
</div>
  </body>
</html>